# {{.Slug}}

Smallest-possible Reactor workflow. Reads a JSON payload from a webhook
and echoes it back into the journal.

Generated by `reactor new cron-echo {{.Slug}}` on {{.Date}}.

## Run it locally

```bash
reactor workflow build --src . --slug {{.Slug}}
reactor workflow register --db sqlite://./reactor.db --slug {{.Slug}} --src main.go
reactor serve --db sqlite://./reactor.db
```

Then trigger it via webhook (after seeding a triggers row) and watch the
run land at `http://127.0.0.1:7777/runs`.
